<% content_for :title, "Privacy Policy — SoShop" %>

<nav class="public-nav">
  <%= link_to root_path, class: "brand" do %>
    <span class="brand-mark">S</span> SoShop
  <% end %>
</nav>

<main class="content" style="max-width: 760px">
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-body" style="padding: 2rem">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-muted text-sm">Last updated: <%= Date.new(2026, 7, 18).strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %></p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        SoShop (elitelouise.com) is a commerce platform that lets independent
        sellers run online bag stores. Each seller operates their own shop;
        this policy covers the platform as a whole.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Customers signing in with Facebook:</strong> when you use
        "Continue with Facebook", we receive and store your Facebook user ID,
        your name, your email address (if you grant it) and your profile
        picture URL. We use these solely to create and operate your customer
        account with the shop you signed in to. We do not post to Facebook or
        access your friends, timeline or any other Facebook data.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Order data:</strong> orders you place, delivery addresses you
        save and related payment records are stored so the seller can fulfil
        your purchases. Your data is only visible to the shop you bought from
        and to the platform operator.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Sellers:</strong> we store your name, store name, email
        address and the business records (customers, orders, payments,
        invoices) generated by your shop.
      </p>

      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell personal data, share it with third parties for
        advertising, or use it for any purpose beyond operating the shops on
        this platform.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We use strictly necessary session cookies to keep you signed in. No
        tracking or advertising cookies are used.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention &amp; deletion</h2>
      <p>
        Account data is kept while your account is active. You can request
        deletion of your data at any time — see our
        <%= link_to "data deletion instructions", data_deletion_path %>.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p class="mb-0">
        For privacy questions or requests, email
        <a href="mailto:privacy@elitelouise.com">privacy@elitelouise.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<div class="footer">
  <%= link_to "Home", root_path %> · <%= link_to "Data deletion", data_deletion_path %>
</div>
